=== obl-1: CTE body with ORDER BY (no LIMIT) — permanent rejection ===
ORDER BY inside CTE body 'sums' is not supported. It is only supported at the main SELECT level; accepting it here would silently ignore it, changing results compared to MySQL.
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: ORDER BY / LIMIT in a CTE body or subquery is not supported.

